Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: amlogic: name Capsula Mini board files accurately

Keep the original upstream board configuration byte-for-byte. Only change
its DTS/defconfig filenames and the Amlogic DTS Makefile target.

---
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/Makefile b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/Makefile
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/Makefile
@@ -17 +17 @@
-dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_MESON) += meson-axg-s420-marusia-mini.dtb
+dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_MESON) += meson-axg-capsula-mini.dtb
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/meson-axg-s420-marusia-mini.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/meson-axg-capsula-mini.dts
similarity index 100%
rename from arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/meson-axg-s420-marusia-mini.dts
rename to arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/meson-axg-capsula-mini.dts
diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/marusia_mini_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/capsula_mini_defconfig
similarity index 100%
rename from arch/arm64/configs/marusia_mini_defconfig
rename to arch/arm64/configs/capsula_mini_defconfig
